<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="uz">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>Global Trade Uzbekistan</title>

  <meta name="description"
        content="Global Trade Uzbekistan — xalqaro konsalting, ishga joylashtirish, ta'lim, turizm va savdo xizmatlari.">

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      background: #f5f7fb;
      color: #172033;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    header {
      background: #0b1f3a;
      color: white;
      padding: 18px 7%;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 10;
    }

    .logo {
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    nav a {
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin-left: 18px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .hero {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0b1f3a, #1769aa);
      color: white;
      padding: 90px 7%;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 42px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .hero p {
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: auto;
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 30px;
      background: white;
      color: #0b1f3a;
      padding: 13px 25px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    section {
      padding: 60px 7%;
    }

    .title {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 35px;
    }

    .title h2 {
      font-size: 30px;
      color: #0b1f3a;
    }

    .cards {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .card {
      background: white;
      padding: 25px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.08);
    }

    .card h3 {
      color: #1769aa;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .countries {
      background: #eaf1f8;
    }

    .country-list {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .country {
      background: white;
      padding: 12px 18px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 3px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.07);
    }

    .contact {
      text-align: center;
      background: #0b1f3a;
      color: white;
    }

    .contact h2 {
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .contact a {
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    footer {
      background: #071426;
      color: #ccc;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 650px) {
      .hero h1 {
        font-size: 32px;
      }

      nav {
        display: none;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
  <div class="logo">GLOBAL TRADE UZ</div>

  <nav>
    <a href="#xizmatlar">Xizmatlar</a>
    <a href="#davlatlar">Davlatlar</a>
    <a href="#bizhaqimizda">Biz haqimizda</a>
    <a href="#aloqa">Aloqa</a>
  </nav>
</header>

<section class="hero">
  <h1>Global Trade Uzbekistan</h1>

  <p>
    Xalqaro konsalting, ishga joylashtirish, ta'lim,
    turizm va xalqaro savdo xizmatlari.
  </p>

  <a class="button" href="#aloqa">Biz bilan bog‘lanish</a>
</section>

<section id="bizhaqimizda">
  <div class="title">
    <h2>Biz haqimizda</h2>
  </div>

  <p style="max-width:850px;margin:auto;text-align:center;">
    Global Trade Uzbekistan — O‘zbekiston fuqarolari va xalqaro
    hamkorlar o‘rtasida xizmatlar, ta’lim, ishga joylashtirish,
    turizm va savdo yo‘nalishlarida hamkorlikni rivojlantirishga
    yo‘naltirilgan kompaniya.
  </p>
</section>

<section id="xizmatlar">
  <div class="title">
    <h2>Bizning xizmatlarimiz</h2>
  </div>

  <div class="cards">

    <div class="card">
      <h3>🌍 Xalqaro konsalting</h3>
      <p>
        Xalqaro hamkorlik va biznes loyihalari bo‘yicha
        maslahat xizmatlari.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h3>👷 Ishga joylashtirish</h3>
      <p>
        Xorijiy ish beruvchilar bilan hamkorlik qilish
        va qonuniy ish imkoniyatlarini izlashda yordam.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h3>🎓 Ta'lim</h3>
      <p>
        O‘zbekiston va xorijiy ta'lim muassasalari bilan
        hamkorlik va ta'lim imkoniyatlari.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h3>✈️ Turizm</h3>
      <p>
        Xalqaro turizm yo‘nalishlari va sayohat xizmatlarini
        tashkil etish.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h3>📄 Hujjatlar bo‘yicha yordam</h3>
      <p>
        Viza va boshqa hujjatlarni tayyorlash jarayonida
        axborot va tashkiliy yordam.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h3>📦 Global Trade</h3>
      <p>
        Xalqaro savdo, eksport-import va biznes hamkorlik
        yo‘nalishlarini rivojlantirish.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<section id="davlatlar" class="countries">

  <div class="title">
    <h2>Hamkorlik yo‘nalishlari</h2>
  </div>

  <div class="country-list">
    <div class="country">🇺🇿 O‘zbekiston</div>
    <div class="country">🇩🇪 Germaniya</div>
    <div class="country">🇨🇳 Xitoy</div>
    <div class="country">🇶🇦 Qatar</div>
    <div class="country">🇦🇪 BAA</div>
    <div class="country">🇹🇷 Turkiya</div>
    <div class="country">🇰🇷 Koreya</div>
    <div class="country">🇱🇹 Litva</div>
    <div class="country">🇨🇿 Chexiya</div>
    <div class="country">🇺🇸 AQSH</div>
    <div class="country">🇬🇧 Angliya</div>
    <div class="country">🇸🇰 Slovakiya</div>
  </div>

</section>

<section id="aloqa" class="contact">

  <h2>Biz bilan bog‘laning</h2>

  <p>
    Global Trade Uzbekistan
  </p>

  <p>
    Surxondaryo viloyati, Uzun tumani
  </p>

  <p style="margin-top:15px;">
    Telefon: +998 XX XXX XX XX
  </p>

  <p>
    Email: info@example.com
  </p>

</section>

<footer>
  © 2026 Global Trade Uzbekistan. Barcha huquqlar himoyalangan.
</footer>

</body>
</html>
